// =====================================================================
//  IMAGINA SÓ, GRAVITY: the shots (16:9); helpers shared with the money video. Cast, sets and the HUD in world.ts, the shot list in tools/make-scenes.py.
//  Framing: ground ~ y 940, captions y 860–930. Tuco (kid, tall 1.22): head ~ 427*s above the feet; adults ~ 507*s.
